},{"language":"no-NO","title":"Harald og Sonja","overview":"I ni lange år kjemper kronprins Harald og den borgerlige Sonja Haraldsen for retten til å gifte seg, men valget er ikke deres å ta. Grunnloven slår fast at en prins ikke kan gifte seg uten kongens tillatelse. Dersom Harald velger en kone uten kongelig blod risikerer det norske monarkiet å falle. Harald og Sonja står sammen og trosser regjeringen, pressen og det norske folk – alt for kjærligheten."}],"images":{"logos":[],"posters":[{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/k8xaFgiNxP3l7ax6EKAt9GGP9G3.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/k8xaFgiNxP3l7ax6EKAt9GGP9G3.jpg","language":"it","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/9VQ1XVhiRJrQMyicfBILgqCqyn5.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/9VQ1XVhiRJrQMyicfBILgqCqyn5.jpg","language":"en","width":2000,"height":3000},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/bKpDa3Xm4kNlLe9idD38DoI8id4.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/bKpDa3Xm4kNlLe9idD38DoI8id4.jpg","language":"no","width":1000,"height":1500},{"type":"poster","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4LsqHdFAkjPVepYCTWt1lStGTvG.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/4LsqHdFAkjPVepYCTWt1lStGTvG.jpg","language":"no","width":1560,"height":2340}],"backdrops":[{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/n8bUToj4GNMVibfZ8qNvhB6q66R.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/n8bUToj4GNMVibfZ8qNvhB6q66R.jpg","language":"en","width":1280,"height":720},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/Ahti6buBgHcuhxOP5BfOd8uQGWp.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/Ahti6buBgHcuhxOP5BfOd8uQGWp.jpg","language":"en","width":3840,"height":2160},{"type":"backdrop","url":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/pN1eU6VssaAHQfHHhwiMI5bTkZH.jpg","previewUrl":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/pN1eU6VssaAHQfHHhwiMI5bTkZH.jpg","language":"xx","w